From: Oath <oath@local>
Subject: Mark sound cards SOUND_INITIALIZED in monitor events too

PR 69 sets SOUND_INITIALIZED on devices made from sysfs
(udev_device_new_from_syspath), which enumeration uses; a monitor builds
its devices from the uevent (udev_device_new_from_uevent), so PipeWire
ignored every card that appeared after its monitor started.

--- a/udev_device.c
+++ b/udev_device.c
@@ -746,6 +746,7 @@
 
     set_properties_from_props(udev_device);
     set_properties_from_evdev(udev_device);
+    is_sound_initialized(udev_device, syspath);
     return udev_device;
 }
 
